    "detailed_description": "<h1>Contact Us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399370/extras/22bf4124b17c2e9c209f4ac02e9c6a0f.poster.avif?t=1751361110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399370/extras/22bf4124b17c2e9c209f4ac02e9c6a0f.webm?t=1751361110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1399370/extras/22bf4124b17c2e9c209f4ac02e9c6a0f.mp4?t=1751361110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Cute Honey 2 is a casual strategy game, how to get the liquid into the cup is the core of the game.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two cute and sexy girls, which one do you prefer?<br></li><li>Fun and creative paintbrush game<br></li><li>Thirty new levels for you to play<br></li><li>Secrets of girls, a variety of sex positions, all up to you to explore</li></ul><br>More exquisite achievements and background display pictures are waiting for you to experience.",
    "about_the_game": "Cute Honey 2 is a casual strategy game, how to get the liquid into the cup is the core of the game.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two cute and sexy girls, which one do you prefer?<br></li><li>Fun and creative paintbrush game<br></li><li>Thirty new levels for you to play<br></li><li>Secrets of girls, a variety of sex positions, all up to you to explore</li></ul><br>More exquisite achievements and background display pictures are waiting for you to experience.",
    "short_description": "This is a casual water catching game. The girls in the game have different CGs and a variety of costumes and props. A new storyline and voice text have been added to the game. You can learn about the girls' stories through various clues. The secret hidden in the girl is waiting for you to discover.",
